# SaaS Boilerplate Project Structure

This is a full-stack SaaS application built as a monorepo with three main components. Always refer to component-specific README.md files for detailed information about each directory.

## 🏗️ Project Architecture

### 1. **API Server** (`/api/`)
- **Tech Stack**: Node.js, Express, TypeScript, MongoDB, Mongoose, Socket.IO, Stripe
- **Purpose**: Backend API server providing authentication, team management, real-time communication
- **Key Features**: 
  - Google OAuth & passwordless authentication  
  - Stripe payment integration
  - AWS S3 file uploads, AWS SES email sending
  - WebSocket real-time communication
- **Entry Point**: [api/server/server.ts](mdc:api/server/server.ts)
- **Config**: [api/package.json](mdc:api/package.json), [api/nodemon.json](mdc:api/nodemon.json)

### 2. **Client Application** (`/app/`)
- **Tech Stack**: Next.js, React, TypeScript, Material-UI, MobX
- **Purpose**: User-facing web application with SSR
- **Key Features**:
  - Server-side rendering with Next.js
  - Material-UI component library
  - MobX state management
  - Protected routes with authentication HOC
- **Entry Point**: [app/pages/_app.tsx](mdc:app/pages/_app.tsx)
- **Config**: [app/package.json](mdc:app/package.json), [app/next.config.js](mdc:app/next.config.js)

### 3. **Lambda Functions** (`/lambda/`)
- **Tech Stack**: Node.js, TypeScript, Serverless Framework
- **Purpose**: Serverless functions for AWS Lambda
- **Entry Point**: [lambda/handler.ts](mdc:lambda/handler.ts)
- **Config**: [lambda/serverless.yml](mdc:lambda/serverless.yml)

### 4. **E2E Testing** (`/e2e/`)
- **Tech Stack**: Playwright, TypeScript, MongoDB Memory Server, Node.js
- **Purpose**: End-to-end testing infrastructure for full-stack integration testing
- **Key Features**:
  - Automated server lifecycle management (API + App servers)
  - In-memory MongoDB for isolated database testing
  - Parallel test execution with worker isolation
  - Screenshot/video recording on failures
  - Docker and native CI/CD support
- **Entry Point**: [e2e/global-setup.ts](mdc:e2e/global-setup.ts)
- **Config**: [e2e/playwright.config.ts](mdc:e2e/playwright.config.ts), [e2e/package.json](mdc:e2e/package.json)

